WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The work I do for you doesn’t count.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
There is no reward without your own contribution

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,310
I am a tolerant person

4
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:09,790
give you another chance

5
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:11,790
Which team at the scene is willing to stand up and say

6
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:13,790
Killed the mourner for Hope Base

7
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:16,400
As long as someone recognizes it

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,400
I'll do the math for you

9
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:22,530
Did you see it?

10
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,530
Even if I am willing to settle it for you

11
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:27,330
No one wants it either

12
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,330
But here

13
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:32,220
We brought you here

14
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,220
correct it

15
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,220
It wasn't you who took us

16
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,220
It was you who took them

17
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,220
Captain Qi, you won’t lose your memory, will you?

18
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,220
I have long been famous by your action team

19
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,220
I don’t have a share in sharing the food.

20
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,220
Not even a team member

21
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,220
Now you take the credit for the map on me

22
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,220
Do you think it makes sense?
